01:07:52,104 --> 01:07:55,604
ショーウィンドウの服着替えて
into a slightly trend-based girly style in the shop window.

651
01:07:55,604 --> 01:07:59,104
魔法のような (ちょっとcoolでpopなparty time)
Like magic (a little cool and pop party time),

652
01:07:59,104 --> 01:08:02,604
ドレスがふわりっひるがえる
your dress flutters and billows softly.

653
01:08:02,604 --> 01:08:07,604
満天の星空にほら 浮かべてみて明日のビジョン
Just look, float tomorrow's vision in the starry sky.

654
01:08:07,604 --> 01:08:10,604
そこで見える そこで見えるなら もっと飛べるよ
If you can see it there, if you can see it there, you can fly even higher.

655
01:08:10,604 --> 01:08:15,604
満開の笑顔ならほら 歌ってみてこのトキメキ
With a full-blossoming smile, just try singing this excitement.

656
01:08:15,604 --> 01:08:18,604
そこで会える そこで会えるから だってきっと世界は変わるから！
Because we'll meet there, because we'll meet there—surely the world will change!

657
01:08:18,604 --> 01:08:22,104
星を紡いで 夢を描くよ
Weaving the stars, painting a dream,

658
01:08:22,104 --> 01:08:25,604
焦がれたその声が呼んでいるの
that yearning voice is calling out.

659
01:08:25,604 --> 01:08:29,104
キラめくカラー まとった君に 届けるこのメロディ
To you, draped in shimmering colors, I deliver this melody.

660
01:08:29,104 --> 01:08:32,604
このままじゃね終われない (終われない)
We can't just end it like this (we can't)

661
01:08:32,604 --> 01:08:36,104
SpecialなStage 踊り明かすの (明かそう)
dancing the night away on a special stage (let's light it up).

662
01:08:36,104 --> 01:08:39,604
このままじっとしてられない (そうさせない)
We can't just stay still like this (won't let you)

663
01:08:39,604 --> 01:08:42,604
走り出そうよ 世界は変わるから
Let's start running, because the world will change.

664
01:09:08,604 --> 01:09:12,604
パッと弾けた感情に 言い訳を並べて過ごした
I spent my days lining up excuses for my bursting emotions.

665
01:09:12,604 --> 01:09:16,104
葛藤も知らない街明かり 君だけだって嘘をついた
Under city lights oblivious to my struggles, I lied and said it was only you.

666
